KNOWNBUG libcxx
views_transform.cpp
--cpp20 --stdlib libc++ --object-bits 12 --unwind 8
^\[main\.assertion\.1\] line \d+ transform: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.2\] line \d+ WRONG \(must FAIL\): FAILURE$
^VERIFICATION FAILED$
^EXIT=10$
^SIGNAL=0$
--
^warning: ignoring
^CONVERSION ERROR$
dropped the body of system-header function
--
libc++ (LLVM 18) std::views::transform: transform_view's end and its
iterator's operator++ lose their bodies, and main cannot be fully
type-checked. clang++ 18 -stdlib=libc++ accepts this program, and it fails
only its WRONG assertion.
